   6:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   7:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *          functionalities of the FLASH extended peripheral:
   8:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *           + Extended programming operations functions
   9:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *  
