  12:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                    ##### Flash Extended features #####
  13:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  14:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            
  15:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   [..] Comparing to other previous devices, the FLASH interface for STM32L4xx 
  16:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        devices contains the following additional features 
  17:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        
  18:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) Capacity up to 2 Mbyte with dual bank architecture supporting read-while-write
  19:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            capability (RWW)
  20:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) Dual bank memory organization       
  21:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) PCROP protection for all banks
  22:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****    
  23:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                         ##### How to use this driver #####
  24:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****  ==============================================================================
  25:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   [..] This driver provides functions to configure and program the FLASH memory 
  26:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        of all STM32L4xx devices. It includes
  27:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) Flash Memory Erase functions: 
  28:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the FLASH interface using HAL_FLASH_Unlock() and 
  29:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_Lock() functions
  30:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Erase function: Erase page, erase all sectors
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccXa2TeX.s 			page 2


  31:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) There are two modes of erase :
  32:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              (+++) Polling Mode using HAL_FLASHEx_Erase()
  33:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              (+++) Interrupt Mode using HAL_FLASHEx_Erase_IT()
  34:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                          
  35:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) Option Bytes Programming function: Use HAL_FLASHEx_OBProgram() to :
  36:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         (++) Set/Reset the write protection
  37:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         (++) Set the Read protection Level
  38:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         (++) Program the user Option Bytes
  39:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         (++) Configure the PCROP protection
  40:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         
  41:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) Get Option Bytes Configuration function: Use HAL_FLASHEx_OBGetConfig() to :
  42:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         (++) Get the value of a write protection area
  43:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         (++) Know if the read protection is activated
  44:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         (++) Get the value of the user Option Bytes
  45:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****         (++) Get the value of a PCROP area
  46:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****     
  47:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****  @endverbatim                      
